<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIAN INDOOR RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIAN INDOOR RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Croatian Indoor men's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Tomas Carbonell (Spain) 2-6 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Francisco Montana (U.S.) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Magnus Norman 7-6 (7-5) 6-7 (4-7) 7-5</p>
<p>7-David Prinosil (Germany) beat Ivan Ljubicic (Croatia) 6-7 (5-7) 6-3 6-0</p>
<p>Alex Radulescu (Romania) beat 8-Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) 7-6 (9-7) 6-2</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat 6-Renzo Furlan (Italy)  6-3 7-5.</p>
</text>
